    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d534">

                <pb facs="0735" n="641" xml:id="pg641"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rockhill to Mr. Taylor.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-09-08"><hi rendition="#italic">September 8,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>In view of excessive hardship of Glean brothers’ case, ask at once or prompt
                    termination proceedings or immediate release.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rockhill</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
